"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"You can use options to customize the Sampler primitive. This section focuses on how to specify IBM Quantum primitive options. While the interface of the primitives' `run()`  method is common across all implementations, their options are not. Consult the corresponding API references for information about the [`qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2) and [`qiskit_aer.primitives.SamplerV2`](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.primitives.SamplerV2.html) options.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
